s it as a quiet, recognizable drawer, and[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]ALL-CAPS stops being structure after a gated, multi-host-safe [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]migration.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim] Counts: [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]11[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] phases[dim][/dim] · [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]8[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] waves[/dim]\n[dim]   Path: [#87AFFF][/dim]plan:202611/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]true_case_drawers.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim] Prompt: [#87AFFF][/dim]prompts/202611/true_case_drawers.md[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Bead: [#87AFFF][/dim]bob-cli-ph[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Page: [#87AFFF][/dim]https://github.com/bobs-org/bob-cli--beads/blob/main/pages/bob-cli-ph/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]README.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim]  1 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Dual-read drawer recognizer, readers, and outside-text escape[/bold #D7AFFF] [bold white on #D75F87] large  [/bold white on #D75F87]\n    [#AF87FF]drawer-contract[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]drawer-contract: one recognizer that reads `- **Title**` and legacy [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]ALL-CAPS drawers, the true-case drawer model and Unicode key, every [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]bob-cli vault reader retargeted, the `__…__` escape for imported text, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]DV/DH vectors, and the task-drawers contract page, with every writer [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]left unchanged.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]One plugin recognizer twin and dual-read plugin readers[/bold #D7AFFF]       [bold white on #D75F87] large  [/bold white on #D75F87]\n    [#AF87FF]plugin-readers[dim] · [dim][/dim]after drawer-contract[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]plugin-readers: one byte-identical recognizer twin replaces every [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]drifted plugin copy, the DV/DH vectors are copied, and every plugin [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]reader accepts both drawer forms; deployed with plugin writers [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]unchanged.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  3 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Every host reads bold drawers before any writer flips[/bold #D7AFFF]         [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]reader-rollout[dim] · [dim][/dim]after drawer-contract, plugin-readers[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]reader-rollout: a host-currency script plus a gated check that bob on [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]athena, apollo, and the Mac and the vault's deployed plugins all read [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]bold drawers.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  4 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Every bob-cli writer emits bold drawer headers[/bold #D7AFFF]                [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]bob-writers[dim] · [dim][/dim]after reader-rollout[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]bob-writers: every bob-cli writer creates `- **Title**` and `- [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]**Notes**` headers, leaves existing headers untouched, and flips the [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]writer vectors.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  5 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Drawer rename respells and inventories legacy drawers[/bold #D7AFFF]         [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]drawer-rename[dim] · [dim][/dim]after bob-writers[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]drawer-rename: `bob task rename-drawer` writes NEW verbatim, allows [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]case-only respelling, and gains a read-only legacy inventory for the [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]migration.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  6 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]One place resolver and bold drawer drafts in capture[/bold #D7AFFF]          [bold white on #D75F87] large  [/bold white on #D75F87]\n    [#AF87FF]capture-drawers[dim] · [dim][/dim]after bob-writers[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]capture-drawers: one place resolver for drawers, project sections, and [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]notebook sections; bold draft forms in all four container contexts; [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]`drawer_marker` spans, `**Title**` menu rows, preview drawer [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]annotations, the `*` rewrite, catalog spelling preference, and grammar [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]30.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  7 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Obsidian drawer rendering, typing, and bold writers[/bold #D7AFFF]           [bold white on #D75F87] large  [/bold white on #D75F87]\n    [#AF87FF]obsidian-drawers[dim] · [dim][/dim]after bob-writers[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]obsidian-drawers: the drawer glyph and true-case title in Live Preview [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]and reading view, the `*` typing assists and Toggle Drawer, bold plugin [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]writers, and verbatim promotion and reversal.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  8 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Bob Mac Capture drawer rendering and typing[/bold #D7AFFF]                   [bold white on #D75F87] large  [/bold white on #D75F87]\n    [#AF87FF]mac-drawers[dim] · [dim][/dim]after capture-drawers[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]mac-drawers: the Mac renders bob's drawer spans and preview annotations,[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]dims the delimiters, drives the `*` assist through capture-rewrite, and [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]stops uppercasing drawer titles.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  9 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Reviewed migration of legacy ALL-CAPS drawers[/bold #D7AFFF]                 [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]vault-migration[dim] · [dim][/dim]after drawer-rename, capture-drawers, obsidian-drawers[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]vault-migration: confirm every host writes bold, inventory the legacy [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]drawers, and apply Bryan's per-line rename or release decisions through [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]a gate.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  10 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Retire ALL-CAPS drawer recognition[/bold #D7AFFF]                           [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]cutov